14. On 4th February, 2021, in the context of the above communication, this Court directed AIIMS to place on record the following details:
i) The details of the therapy provided to the patient, mentioned in the order of the Office of the Commissioner, Commercial Tax, Uttar Pradesh dated 19th August 2019;
